Answer: Yes, according to Axios reporting cited in the search result, Donald Trump did suggest using a nuclear bomb to disrupt hurricanes. Specifically, during a White House briefing, he reportedly asked, "Why don't we nuke them?" and proposed that "we drop a bomb inside the eye of the hurricane and it disrupts it." The article notes he raised this idea "multiple times" in meetings with national security officials.

Source URL: https://www.commondreams.org/news/2019/08/26/refusing-take-real-climate-action-trump-reportedly-suggests-using-nukes-stop

