Answer: According to the search result, Donald Trump's reported suggestion about using a nuclear bomb to address hurricanes was made during a hurricane briefing with top national security officials early in his first year as president (circa 2017), as detailed in a National Security Council memorandum and later reported by Axios in August 2019.

